^{:go/breaks [7] :go/end 238} (go/method associate "associate installs the new template into the group of templates associated\nwith t. The two are already known to share the common structure.\nThe boolean return value reports whether to store this tree as t.Tree.\n" ^bool [^{:tag (* Template)} t ^{:tag (* Template)} new ^{:tag (* parse/Tree)} tree]
